    "title": "Nanit Sound and Light",
    "description": "We\u2019re not just monitoring sleep, we\u2019re now helping to improve it with the newest addition to the Nanit family. Our smart nursery essential combines a sound machine with a customizable night light to help your littles fall asleep,  stay asleep longer, and set every sleepy-time routine to CALM.\r\nThe Sound and Light app unlocks a library of uber-relaxing sound and light options, making it simple to quickly create a customized routine. This allows every family to create healthy sleep habits from the start. Establish even more confidence in your child\u2019s sleep routines, brought to you by the same innovation that allows you to parent confidently.",
